{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UsingIvorModel"],"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Project","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work"],"anchor":"Projects-and-works","title":"Projects and works"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Part","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/NoteTable","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/NoteEvent"],"anchor":"Parts-and-notes","title":"Parts and notes"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Dynamic","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Instrument","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/InstrumentMap","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PanMap","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/MapTargets"],"anchor":"Parameter-maps","title":"Parameter maps"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Realization","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PatchTable","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Patch"],"anchor":"Realizations","title":"Realizations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TemplateDuration","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TemplatePitch"],"anchor":"Templates","title":"Templates"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Credit","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/RightsNotice","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Remark"],"anchor":"Descriptive-information","title":"Descriptive information"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UniqueID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/WorkID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PartID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/NoteID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/RealizationID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TemplateID"],"anchor":"Identifiers","title":"Identifiers"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"IvorModel","role":"collection","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}],"title":"IvorModel"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A representation-agnostic musical composition model.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"IvorModel is the foundational data-modeling framework for the Ivor music","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ecosystem, providing a representation-agnostic model for musical compositions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written in Swift.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Designed as a flexible composer’s assistant, IvorModel bridges the gap between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"abstract symbolic notation and physical audio performance through a unified,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dual-paradigm architecture. Compositions are organized as projects containing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"works, each broken into parts with note events, dynamics, panning, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instrumentation — all captured at a level natural to a composer, without being","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tied to any particular notation system, audio format, or instrument family.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A template system rounds out the model, enabling analysis of existing works and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"algorithmic generation of new, derived ones. Together these capabilities make it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"straightforward to aggregate, analyze, and transform musical data from disparate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sources before exporting to any destination.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The model is oriented toward Western musical traditions but is not confined to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Western classical music, and aims to accommodate a broader range of musical","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"practice where possible.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import IvorModel","import IvorTiming","import IvorTuning","","\/\/ A work in beat time and standard pitch, with one part.","var work = Work(name: \"Etude\",","                content: .empty(timeBasis: .beat,","                                pitchNotation: .standard))","let melody = try work.addPart(name: \"Melody\")","","let notes: [(BeatTime, String)] = [(0, \"C4\"), (1, \"E4\"), (2, \"G4\"), (3, \"E4\"),","                                   (4, \"C4\"), (5, \"G3\"), (6, \"C4\")]","","try work.modifyPart(melody, as: Part<BeatTime, Pitch>.self) { part in","    for (attack, name) in notes {","        part.noteTable.insert(attack: attack,","                              duration: 1,","                              pitch: Pitch(plain: name)!)","    }","}","","\/\/ Transpose it up a fifth, then convert it to wall time and MIDI note numbers.","try work.transpose(by: DirectedInterval(interval: .perfect5,","                                        direction: .ascending))","","let midi = try work.convert(timeBasis: .wall,","                            pitchNotation: .keyboard)!","","\/\/ Learn the melody, and generate a 12-note variation of it.","let template = try Template.analyzeNoteEvents(in: work,","                                              at: 0,","                                              maximumOrder: 2,","                                              name: \"Melody\")","let options  = Template.GenerationOptions<BeatTime, Pitch>(order: 1,","                                                           length: .noteCount(12),","                                                           stopsAtEnd: false)","let variation = try template.generateWork(name: \"Variation\",","                                          partName: \"Melody\",","                                          options: options,","                                          seed: 42)","","\/\/ Keep them in a project, and save it.","var project = Project()","","project.updateWork(work)","project.updateTemplate(template)","","let file = try project.save()               \/\/ a FileWrapper"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UsingIvorModel","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for a full guide to works, parts, notes, parameter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"maps, transforms, conversion, realizations, templates, and projects.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Pan/Angle":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan\/Angle","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/pan\/angle","abstract":[{"text":"An angle, in degrees, that wraps into the half-open range ","type":"text"},{"code":"(-180, 180]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Angle","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Pan.Angle"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Pan":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/pan","abstract":[{"text":"A spatial pan position: the direction of a sound in 3-D space relative to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the listener, expressed as a horizontal and a vertical ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan\/Angle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in degrees.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Pan","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Pan","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Pan"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel":{"abstract":[{"text":"A representation-agnostic musical composition model.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel","title":"IvorModel"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Work":{"abstract":[{"text":"A musical work containing parts and associated data.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Work","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Work","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/work","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Work","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/EntryID":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A unique identity for an entry in a time-keyed map, represented as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"validated string.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EntryID","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/entryid","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntryID","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/UniqueID":{"abstract":[{"text":"A unique identity represented as a validated, prefixed string.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/uniqueid","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UniqueID","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UniqueID","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UniqueID","type":"topic","title":"UniqueID"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/PartID":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PartID","abstract":[{"text":"A unique ID for a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Part","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", represented as a validated string.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/partid","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PartID","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PartID","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PartID"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/InstrumentMap":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/InstrumentMap","abstract":[{"text":"A time-indexed map of instrument designations with a configurable default.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/instrumentmap","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InstrumentMap","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InstrumentMap","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"InstrumentMap"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Template":{"abstract":[{"text":"An analysis of a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" tha